Seahik
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
TRIG 9 FACE_LAST

FAEQOJ 1 FACE_HALF
FAEQOJ 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
FAEQOJ 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
FAEQOJ 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE_STACK TRIG FAEQOJ
DEST Suit {HEARTS}
MOVE_STACK TRIG TRIG
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
        SRCSTACK Size == 0
    DEST Suit {SPADES, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}
$win
PILE ALL FAEQOJ Empty
